title: Add shared AURA authorizer utilities for JAM
doc:
- audience:
  - Node Dev
  description: |-
    Add cumulus-aura-authorizer-utils with shared configuration, token and trace types,
    collator membership proofs, work-package signing, and generic signature verification.
    WorkPackageBody supports signing before attaching an authorization token.
    Use jam-types 0.1.29, including the anchor slot and lookup anchor state root in
    signed work packages. Expose hashing of complete work packages so consumers can
    use the shared implementation without a version-specific adapter.
crates:
- name: cumulus-aura-authorizer-utils
  bump: minor
